# cedian_worktree_request — cedian_worktree_request

cedian's own host tool (trusted). Ask the cedian IDE for an isolated git worktree for a parallel worker; never run `git worktree add` yourself. Returns the worktree id and path.

## Schema
```ts
type Args = {
  /** branch or commit (default HEAD) */
  base?: string;
  /** worker id: [A-Za-z0-9._-] */
  id: string;
  kind?: string;
  title: string;
};
```
Execute by writing JSON to xd://cedian_worktree_request.

